msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"tutorials/fractional-gates.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Usage estimate: under 30 seconds on a Heron r2 processor (NOTE: This is an "
