"- Qiskit SDK v2.0 以降、[可視化](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/visualization)サポート付き\n"
"- Qiskit Runtime v0.37 以降（`pip install qiskit-ibm-runtime`）\n"
"- Qiskit Basis Constructor（`pip install qiskit_basis_constructor`）\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr "セットアップ {#setup}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Enable fractional gates and check basis gates {#enable-fractional-gates-and-"
"check-basis-gates}"
msgstr "分数ゲートの有効化と基底ゲートの確認 {#enable-fractional-gates-and-check-basis-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
